<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Burnham Pacific as strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Burnham Pacific as strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Andrew Jones initiated coverage of Burnham Pacific Properties Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 5/8 to 13-3/8.</p>
